{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD to move, Space to dash!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <i>Survivors-like</i> action game, you\u2019re not the hero \u2014 <strong>you\u2019re the boss</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run for your life as waves of little heroes try to take you down. Collect <strong>gold</strong>, equip <strong>weapons</strong>, and grab <strong>power-ups</strong> to become an unstoppable force. Got duplicates? <strong>Combine two like weapons</strong> to craft even more powerful versions and discover synergies that fuel your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the immersive music and satisfying sounds as you battle through growing hordes. This is an <strong>early playtest</strong> \u2014 and for now, all playable characters are <strong>unlocked</strong>, so you can experiment with a variety of builds and find your favorites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a limited number of waves right now, encouraging shorter sessions and more build variety. As we continue developing alongside our community, <strong>we\u2019d love your feedback</strong>! Let us know what you like, what you don\u2019t, and what you want to see added next.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052630?t=1760342203","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052630/d9461aeca9cfef82f62e3a5bd8df3947fe058942/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760342203","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052630/8e809e872613594406d2239a77bf3fc61555dafe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760342203","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052630/8e809e872613594406d2239a77bf3fc61555dafe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760342203","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD to move, Space to dash!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <i>Survivors-like</i> action game, you\u2019re not the hero \u2014 <strong>you\u2019re the boss</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run for your life as waves of little heroes try to take you down. Collect <strong>gold</strong>, equip <strong>weapons</strong>, and grab <strong>power-ups</strong> to become an unstoppable force. Got duplicates? <strong>Combine two like weapons</strong> to craft even more powerful versions and discover synergies that fuel your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the immersive music and satisfying sounds as you battle through growing hordes. This is an <strong>early playtest</strong> \u2014 and for now, all playable characters are <strong>unlocked</strong>, so you can experiment with a variety of builds and find your favorites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a limited number of waves right now, encouraging shorter sessions and more build variety. As we continue developing alongside our community, <strong>we\u2019d love your feedback</strong>! Let us know what you like, what you don\u2019t, and what you want to see added next.</p>","developers":["PixelPrimacy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052630/302be9eafaf9f1c149ff6b37bcfa70d935902359/header.jpg?t=1760342203","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4052630/2009160846/08da5e5a9be8e8339c7355864e3d3c5728445562/1759982700/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760342201","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4052630/2009160846/08da5e5a9be8e8339c7355864e3d3c5728445562/1759982700/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760342201","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.st